Z||000009||Nashco||10-23-2001||12:07 PM||||I was weirded out by that for a while too!  I usually have lots of programs running at any given time (winamp, morpheus, photoshop, outlook, internet explorer, msn messenger, AIM..well, you get the point); when I heard the noise I had NO idea where it was coming from...drove me nuts trying to figure it out.  Finally figured it out after a few days that it was a new PM notification; I'd never experienced a web page that made a noise if something was new, as Cliff programmed the PM inbox to do...so that was new.  I'm glad I figured it out, I would have gone crazy soon!<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
